    }
  ],
  "events": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 8,
      "actor": "he",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Home,\"",
        "line": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 9,
      "actor": "Isla",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"You lived here?\"",
        "line": 14
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 10,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"For a time,\"",
        "line": 16
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 15,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Or harder,\"",
        "line": 23
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 20,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The Morning Calling,\"",
        "line": 30
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 27,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Star-touched,\"",
        "line": 41
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 29,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Tsunami-Singer,\"",
        "line": 44
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 31,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"As before,\"",
        "line": 47
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 33,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Because the threat we face touches all waters, all shores,\"",
        "line": 50
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 35,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Approaches like a tide that will drown the world,\"",
        "line": 53
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 37,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Elder Coral-Dream,\"",
        "line": 56
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 39,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Not visions,\"",
        "line": 59
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 52,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I am Depth-Speaker Abyssal-Heart,\"",
        "line": 77
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 59,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I know what you seek,\"",
        "line": 86
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 63,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"My apprentice, Current-Shift,\"",
        "line": 92
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 69,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Between states?\"",
        "line": 100
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 71,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Life and death. Consciousness and void. Breathing and drowning.\"",
        "line": 103
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 73,
      "actor": "Lyra",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"You want us to drown?\"",
        "line": 106
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 74,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Not drown,\"",
        "line": 108
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 79,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"You intrigue us,\"",
        "line": 116
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 81,
      "actor": "Sathinee",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The water whispers many things,\"",
        "line": 119
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 82,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Indeed. Including warnings.\"",
        "line": 121
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 84,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Different how?\"",
        "line": 124
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 85,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"It doesn't destroy or control or calculate. It... grieves. Makes the water itself mourn for what was lost. The Tidecallers feel it most keenly\u2014they who sing with the ocean's voice now sometimes hear only sorrow.\"",
        "line": 126
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 89,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"During the trial,\"",
        "line": 132
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 91,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Why tell me this?\"",
        "line": 135
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 92,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Because you, more than the others, might understand. You who were born from collective thought know how emotions can take physical form. In the deep, everything is emotion. Everything is memory.\"",
        "line": 137
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 98,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Nervous?\"",
        "line": 146
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 100,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Contemplative,\"",
        "line": 149
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 102,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"And we gave you neither,\"",
        "line": 152
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 104,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"This trial feels different. More... final.\"",
        "line": 155
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 115,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"You're thinking like a surface dweller,\"",
        "line": 170
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 117,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Between them?\"",
        "line": 173
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 119,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"When you shift from one form to another, there's a moment\u2014infinitesimal\u2014where you're neither. That's where the Breath of the Deep lives. In the space between definitions.\"",
        "line": 176
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 123,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The trial begins with the evening tide,\"",
        "line": 183
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 125,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"All of us,\"",
        "line": 186
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 127,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Brave. Foolish. Perhaps both.\"",
        "line": 189
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 143,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The corruption,\"",
        "line": 210
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 152,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Don't fight it,\"",
        "line": 222
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 174,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Memory,\"",
        "line": 251
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 186,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"You return,\"",
        "line": 267
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 195,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The Breath of the Deep,\"",
        "line": 278
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 197,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Use it wisely. The Nephilim ritual requires all elements in balance. You have gathered them through understanding rather than force. This... this gives hope that the old wounds might finally heal.\"",
        "line": 281
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 201,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The corruption we've faced,\"",
        "line": 288
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 206,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The convergence point,\"",
        "line": 295
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 208,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Ironspire,\"",
        "line": 298
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 210,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"A fitting irony,\"",
        "line": 301
      }
    }
  ],
